  "content": "<p><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1055947/description_0d55d2b2-48a1-4985-9433-6564cfd48979.png\" width=\"228\" height=\"228\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">這個模組新增了經典的<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>IKEA 鯊鯊 (Blåhaj)</strong> </span>玩偶及其一些變體！&nbsp;<em>還有超多變化！</em></p><p><img style=\"width:498.27px;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1168/411/plushiess.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>預設合成配方：</em></strong></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1511/214/recipeblahaj-png.png\" alt=\"RecipeBlahaj.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>模組相容性</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">支援使用切石機配方的模組。（內建與 Create、AE2、Sophisticated Backpacks/Storage 的相容性）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">ReEstrogen</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>切石機合成：</em></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>變體是透過切石機製作的，</em>這使得可以使用其他模組如<strong>AE2</strong>或<strong>Create</strong>進行自動合成</p><p><img style=\"width:590.318px;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1306/440/scutterrrr.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1511/211/untitledvideo-madewithclipchamp10-ezgif-com.gif\" alt=\"Untitledvideo-MadewithClipchamp10-ezgif.com-optimize.gif\" width=\"590\" height=\"332\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>彩虹旗變體：</em></strong></p><p><strong><em><img style=\"width:598.271px;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1266/521/pridevariants.png\" alt=\"\"></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><br>靈感來自 DaFuqsy 的 Fabric 版 Blahaj 模組</em></strong></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><em>（最初是作為該模組的移植版，後來發展成擁有全新模型、材質和功能的獨立專案。）</em></strong><strong><em><br></em></strong></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blahaj-replushed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1550/308/credit-png.png\" alt=\"Credit Inspo\"></a></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><em>GitHub：</em></strong></span></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/toastydoll/Just-Blahaj\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>https://github.com/toastydoll/Just-Blahaj</em></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><em>致謝：</em></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li>巴勒斯坦配色鯊鯊（材質由 nickwasnicked 製作）</li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><strong>如有錯誤或問題，請在留言區或 Discord 回報！</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/75egrCdHa5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1550/299/joinourdiscord-png.png\" alt=\"JoinOurDiscord.png\"></a></p>",
